    "body": "Visitors with reduced motion enabled may otherwise assume the site animations are broken. Show a dismissible notice in the shared toolbar explaining the device/browser preference and offering expandable instructions for Windows and macOS.\n\nThe notice respects the preference, updates when it changes, supports VI/EN, and remembers dismissal for the current tab session. It never overrides motion settings or reloads embedded pages. Web 1 source, demos and animation logic are unchanged.\n\nValidation: production build and all 11 existing unit tests pass. Chrome checks pass for Web 1 and Web 2 at 320/390/768/1440px, covering visibility, dismissal across reload, preference changes, language switching, preserved form input, keyboard focus, and overflow. The notice stays hidden for visitors without reduced motion. No browser JavaScript errors.\n",
